    {
      "id": "missingAccents",
      "type": "boolean",
      "default": false,
      "label": "Text without accents",
      "description": "Also look words up with an accent on the last vowel, for text that leaves it out (puo → può, piu → più). A reading of the word as written still comes first (citta shows citta before città, fara shows faro before fare). Adds less likely readings and makes lookups slower.",
